    <comment>New package: HuggingFace &quot;datasets&quot; -- community library of datasets providing
one-line dataloaders and efficient pre-processing for audio, vision and NLP.

Version 5.0.1, current on PyPI; the sdist md5 matches upstream exactly.
License Apache-2.0, noarch.

All build and runtime dependencies are already in Factory: pyarrow 25.0.0 from
apache-arrow:python-pyarrow satisfies the &gt;= 21.0.0 floor, and alts comes from
libalternatives.

Builds green on x86_64 and aarch64. %check runs the subset of tests the PyPI
sdist actually ships -- tests/utils.py, conftest.py and the fixtures live only
in the GitHub tree, so the modules importing them cannot collect -- plus a
Dataset.map and pickle round-trip smoke test covering the Python 3.14
Pickler._batch_setitems regression fixed upstream in 4.4.0.

i586 and armv7hl are unresolvable because pyarrow there is absent or 19.0.1,
below the required floor.

Proposed devel project: science:machinelearning (maintainer: mslacken).</comment>
